# Config bans the identifier foo (case-insensitive). Hits: declaration (9), uses (12, 13).
# Non-hits: another identifier (10), member access Rec.foo (14: a member of someone
# else's record is not a binding of ours), comment (15), string literal (16).
disallowed-name 9
disallowed-name 12
disallowed-name 13
!disallowed-name 10
!disallowed-name 14
!disallowed-name 15
!disallowed-name 16
